# RaidBossStandard (25019 Pan Dryad, level 11 here, and 25063 at level 12) beside the level 20
# character, every draw 0: the character is more than 8 levels above the first boss, so the hit
# on it makes it want its raid curse 4515 on the character and forget its hate of it (no attack
# desire), and the spell the character casts makes it want its raid mute 4215 on it. The
# second boss, only 8 levels below, fights it as any boss does.
character Hunter 20
skill 4694 1
roll player 0
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
script script.ai.individual.Monster.RaidBoss.RaidBossStandard
script script.ai.individual.Monster.RaidBoss.RaidBossAlone.RaidBossType1.RaidBossType1
npc low 25019 RaidBoss 200 0 0 level 11 skill DEBUFF 4515 1 skill DEBUFF_A 4215 1
npc even 25019 RaidBoss -200 0 0 level 12 skill DEBUFF 4515 1 skill DEBUFF_A 4215 1
npc wolf 20120 Monster 150 100 0

hit low 10
  hate low 0
  desires low cast(player,4515,move)=1000000
hit even 10
  hate even 10526.315789473683
  desires even attack(player)=10526.315789473683
cast wolf 4694
  S MagicSkillUse caster=player target=wolf skill=4694-1 hit=0 reuse=0 success=0
  S SystemMessage id=46 4:4694,1
  desires low cast(player,4515,move)=1000000 cast(player,4215,move)=1000000
